ain.",1],["medal_hidden_45side_02","'Concert Memories'","T2","During the Somniloquium Serenum event, complete all stages in [Somniamus Omnes] with 3-star ratings (excluding tutorials and story stages)","The songs and the screams from their souls, the instruments of their final concert, are forever bound to linger in your mind.\nStranger to you that some of their tribulations may be, you know their determination is made, their die cast, and they will stand and face the music. As will you one day, surely.",1]]}}